      "description_html": "<h4>SOLD OUT — The Fall Bundle is full. No more spots available.</h4><p>Remaining bundle outing: Friday, Nov. 27</p><h4>Thank you, bundle families! 🍂🦋</h4><h4>This bundle is sold out — thank you to every family who joined us this fall! Bundle families: your spot on the Black Friday outing (Nov. 27) is confirmed, and you don't need to buy anything else. Looking for your next adventure? Grab the <a rel=\"noopener\" href=\"https://familyadventuresquad.org/bundles/p/winter-wonders-family-adventure-bundle\">Winter Bundle: Waterfalls + Redwoods</a> while spots last.</h4><h4>🦋 <strong>11/27 — Black Friday: Monarch Butterflies, Tidepools, Beach &amp; Optional Pizza + Ice Cream</strong> (Santa Cruz Area)</h4><h4><strong>✅ ALREADY A BUNDLE FAMILY?</strong></h4><p>You're all set — you do not need to purchase anything on the individual outing pages. Closer to the date, you'll get:</p><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p>digital guide — for the Nov. 27 outing, sent as the date approaches.</p></li><li><p>a WhatsApp invite for the outing</p></li><li><p>any adventure-specific details (like pizza sign-up for Black Friday)</p></li></ul><p><strong>WHAT'S INCLUDED IN EACH ADVENTURE</strong></p><p><strong>A quick taste of what's ahead — full details for each adventure are on individual listing pages, linked below.</strong></p><p>🦋 <strong>11/27 Black Friday (Santa Cruz Area):</strong> An easy hike to see migrating monarch butterflies (kid-friendly telescope included!), tidepooling, a small cave, and stunning sunset views.</p><p><strong>View full listing: </strong><a rel=\"noopener\" href=\"https://familyadventuresquad.org/adventures/p/11/27-blackfriday-monarchbutterflies-beach-tidepools\">Black Friday Monarchs, Tidepools &amp; Beach</a></p>",
