    {
      "title": "Winter Bundle: Waterfalls + Redwoods",
      "url": "https://familyadventuresquad.org/bundles/p/winter-wonders-family-adventure-bundle",
      "tags": [
        "Winter 26/27",
        "Bay Area",
        "Easy",
        "All ages"
      ],
      "description_html": "<p>Both winter day trips in one purchase, with a guaranteed spot at each: waterfalls in December and redwoods on MLK Day.</p><p>Dec. 13 and Jan. 18</p><h4>Your whole winter season, planned for you and your family — with our signature outings! 💦🐌</h4><h4>We have so much FUN on these adventures — they sell out every year — so this season we're capping numbers and prioritizing families who choose the bundle option first. <strong>One purchase here secures your family's spot at both outings below</strong> — no need to visit each outing's individual page or buy anything else. Bundle families get priority booking and guaranteed spots, and your family saves at least $20 compared to booking each one separately.</h4><h4>💦 12/13 — Winter Waterfall Wonderland, Ladybug Love, Leopard-Spotted Banana Slugs + Fungi Hunt (South Bay)<br />🐌 1/18 — MLK Day: Banana Slug Bonanza, 1,700-Year-Old Redwood + Ancient Ocean Rocks (Peninsula)</h4><h4><strong>✅ WHAT HAPPENS AFTER YOU BUY:</strong></h4><p>This is your only checkout — you're done! You do <strong>not</strong> need to purchase anything on the individual outing pages. Closer to each date, you'll get:</p><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p>digital guide — one for each outing, sent separately as that date approaches.</p></li><li><p>a separate WhatsApp invite for each adventure</p></li><li><p>any adventure-specific details (like the Alice's Restaurant headcount for MLK Day)</p></li></ul><p><strong>WHAT'S INCLUDED IN EACH ADVENTURE</strong></p><p><strong>A quick taste of what's ahead — full details for each adventure are on individual listing pages, linked below.</strong></p><p>💦 <strong>12/13 Winter Waterfall (South Bay):</strong> Rushing waterfalls, a fungi hunt, leopard-spotted banana slugs, rock scrambling, a scavenger hunt, and a visit to our Ladybug Christmas Tree (ladybug sightings depend on their migration, but we've seen lots here in past years).</p><p><strong>View full listing: </strong><a rel=\"noopener\" href=\"https://familyadventuresquad.org/adventures/p/12/13-winter-waterfall-ladybugs-banana-slugs-southbay\">Winter Waterfalls, Ladybugs &amp; Banana Slugs</a></p><p>🐌 <strong>1/18 MLK Day (Peninsula):</strong> A 1,700-year-old redwood giant, banana slugs by the dozens (we found 50+ in previous years!), ancient ocean rocks to explore, a nature scavenger hunt, and an optional meal at the legendary Alice's Restaurant.</p><p><strong>View full listing: </strong><a rel=\"noopener\" href=\"https://familyadventuresquad.org/adventures/p/1/18-mlk-day-redwood-banana-slugs-peninsula\">MLK Day Redwoods, Banana Slugs &amp; Ocean Rocks</a></p>",
